  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 953f267c8658fa14abf1746824cdb755, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mechanic
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCInfoSO
  TaskDialogs:
  - ID: 6
    Briefing:
    - Microbreach on deck two. And before you ask, the sealant isn't missing because
      of me.
    Pending:
    - Nice servos on you. Are those original? Relax, I'm not going to do anything
      about it.
    Succeded:
    - Sorted, cheers. I'll owe you one. I won't pay it back.
    Failed:
    - That room's venting! What did you do?
  - ID: 7
    Briefing:
    - Power's failing on this junction, probably because I took a coupling out of
      it last week.
    Pending:
    - These arms? I built them, I built them out of things that were, strictly speaking,
      the ship's.
    Succeded:
    - Runs better than it did before. That's either me or luck, and I'm saying me.
    Failed:
    - Corridor's dark now. And don't pick anything up off that floor, I'll be back
      for it.
  - ID: 8
    Briefing:
    - Airlock servo's dead so it's a manual crank now. Go do your thing.
    Pending:
    - The chef leaves a plate outside my door. If either of us mentions it he'll
      stop, so we don't.
    Succeded:
    - Don't let the others see you can do that.
    Failed:
    - Airlock's jammed shut. Whatever, we'll work round it.
